{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "_comment": [
    "The harness signature (docs/CONTRACTS.md sections 47 and 51; GUIDE.md): what an evaluation report states about the harness,",
    "mapped to the survey Table 3 (Agent Harness Engineering, 2026, p.32). `key_paths` is every key path of a signature in order",
    "(arrays and nulls are leaves); `table3` is each Table 3 configuration row and the field that fills it (null: gnomon cannot).",
    "packages/gnomon-core/src/harness_signature.test.ts asserts these against the code and a real signature."
  ],
